# Build context. Everything here is uploaded to the builder on every deploy, so
# what is NOT excluded costs wall-clock time on each push.
#
# NOTE what is deliberately NOT excluded: models/. The deploy image bakes the
# checkpoint via COPY (a platform has no host filesystem to bind-mount from), so
# excluding it breaks the build. It is ~254MB and it has to travel -- a build-time
# fetch was tried to avoid that and reverted; see docker/deploy.Dockerfile.

# The local virtualenv: ~254MB, needed by nothing in any image, and the single
# biggest thing in the context.
.venv/
venv/

.git/
.gitignore
.githooks/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.mutate-pycache/

# Tests and docs are not installed into any image. The deploy image copies only
# migrations/, scripts/ and src/.
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Local environment and compose overlays -- config is injected by the platform.
.env
docker-compose*.yml

# Presentation deck: deliberately untracked, and no business in an image.
*.pptx

# Scratch
data/
*.log

